  message: "PHASE 0 RE-VERIFICATION AT TIP, 2026-08-25, dev e41a655d6d. REPRODUCES. Both\npredicates are still present and still disagree; the loose one still wins at\nclassify_file step 2. Measured with controls:\n\n  go '// generated by scripts/measure-catalogue-reach.py' : loose=True  strict=False\n  go '// leading comment'                                 : loose=False strict=False\n  py docstring saying 'regenerated by'                    : loose=True  strict=False\n  py plain docstring                                      : loose=False strict=False\n\n_GENERATED_HEADER_PATTERN at tip requires a comment prefix AND one of\n@generated / \"Code generated by ... DO NOT EDIT\" / Autogenerated /\nAUTO-GENERATED / \"automatically generated\". is_likely_minified heuristic 3 is\nstill the bare case-insensitive re.search over the first five lines.\n\nConfirmed Phase 1 member, jointly with INV-bokim -- one predicate, one home."  # 2795
